{"id": 80, "name": "Guinevere", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/8/88/Hero801-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142559", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Burst", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["40", "50", "70", "40"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "Aristocratic girl with a strange temperament, loved by her elder brother Lancelot.", "skills": [{"name": "Super Magic", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_bb87aa7f520dc67fcde6852598c241ca.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Guinevere deals 25% extra damage to airborne enemies and deals <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> with her Basic Attacks. \nGuinevere builds Super Magic each time she deals damage. Once fully charged, her next Basic Attack becomes guided, dealing 80<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+90% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic damage</span> on hit and restoring <span style=\"color:#26e407\">80 plus 8% of her lost HP</span>.\nEnemies hit by Guinevere's skills or enhanced Basic Attack will be marked for 5s. Those with 3 marks will be knocked airborne when hit by her Violet Requiem."}, {"name": "Energy Wave", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_193275791eb7f707158fc5e277a29016.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4", "desc": "Guinevere releases an energy orb in the target direction, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+125% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slowing enemies by 25% for 1.2s.\nSuccessfully hitting an enemy reduces all her skill cooldowns by 1s."}, {"name": "Spatial Migration", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5cd1df58957fa20b29e9c77d5b2067a9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 17", "desc": "Guinevere leaps to the target location, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+80% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. Enemy heroes and Creeps hit will be knocked airborne for 1s and take 125<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> additional <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Guinevere blinks toward the target direction and leaves an illusion behind. If the illusion takes damage by hero, it restores Super Magic for Guinevere and explodes after 1.5s, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+30% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies."}, {"name": "Violet Requiem", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6ad5e6561bec9562a72584c18191a76a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 52", "desc": "Guinevere creates a force field around her, gaining Control Immunity while attacking nearby enemies 11 times within 2s, dealing 880<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+385% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> in total.\nAirborne enemies hit will be knocked airborne again, up to 8 additional times."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e7045efd7cf5bcb488594a7eac3ab4e2.png"}, {"name": "Concentrated Energy", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoyg